flowchart LR
    subgraph browser[User's browser]
        spa[React SPA<br/>React Router, Tailwind, React Flow<br/>access token in memory]
    end
    subgraph server[Application server, Node.js 22]
        api[Express API /api/v1<br/>11 modules, security, audit context]
        worker[Report worker<br/>same process, polls PENDING reports]
        jc[Jira client<br/>timeouts, circuit breaker]
        api --- worker
        api --- jc
    end
    subgraph dbs[PostgreSQL 18]
        db[(19 tables, triggers,<br/>append-only audit_log)]
    end
    spa -->|HTTPS, JSON, Bearer JWT<br/>refresh cookie on /auth| api
    api -->|Prisma 7 + adapter-pg<br/>role docs_app, DML only| db
    worker -->|role docs_app| db
    jc -->|HTTPS REST v3| jira[Jira Cloud TECHEA]
    jira -->|HTTPS webhook, HMAC| api
    mig[prisma migrate deploy<br/>role docs_owner] -->|DDL| db
